  <name>BOOKAH</name>
  <developer_name>Savvy Stuff</developer_name>
  <summary>Build Optimization &amp; Organization for Knowledge-Agnostic Hominids</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      BOOKAH is a sophisticated build maker for Guild Wars 1, featuring PvX wiki integration 
      and a "Smart Mode" that leverages AI to discover skill synergies.
    </p>
    <p>Key Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Behavioral Engine: Analyzes historical meta-build data to identify frequent skill pairings.</li>
      <li>Semantic Engine: Uses Sentence-BERT to map mechanical relationships between skill descriptions.</li>
      <li>Heuristic Mechanics Engine: Validates attributes, energy management, and core build requirements.</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
